instrument wingie
; the music bed under the video manual: the Wingie's own resonators, rung by wind and dust,
; three chords as three scenes, in a long dark cavern. Rendered offline by bed.c.

C and G
-------
the air is wind
the motes is dust 1
the low is wingie 2.18 string decay=0.85
the mid is wingie 2.18 string tune=7st decay=0.85
the high is wingie 2.18 bar tune=16st decay=0.85
the soft is eq high=0.35
the under is cavern samplerate=half size=0.6 dark=0.7
air ~> low mid high
motes ~> mid.strike
motes ~> high.strike
low mid high -> soft
soft ~> under
under.left soft ~> left
under.right soft ~> right

